ABORT-NET04: TELEGRAM_ALLOWED_USER_ID is unset, empty, or non-numeric -- refusing to start the Telegram connector. Set it in the EnvironmentVariables dict of ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.ohama.telegram-connect.plist (numeric Telegram user id), re-run phase-05/services/install_services.sh com.ohama.telegram-connect, then phase-02/infra/restart_service.sh com.ohama.telegram-connect none.
